(text "N-E4-01 — примітка — STACK §5.3 (DC-sense)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 36.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 0 60 150 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6197c131-f35f-51e6-a7c1-36c13593ca36))
(text "Позначення R44xx/C44xx (4400–4499) — задокументований розширений діапазон E4 для DC-детекторів\n(design/E4-review.md), щоб не перетинатися з E5. Решта позначень E4 — у діапазоні 400–499." (at 13.97 38.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid e653a6d7-da9c-5e61-b5e6-6b7b1bccd218))
(rectangle (start 12.7 48.26) (end 149.86 124.46) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 170 0 0 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid ff9ced60-c5af-5773-8d48-da01336bc96a))
(text "E4-06 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.3 (DC-sense); §8.1 HF-10" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 49.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2e342280-b3f9-5ab3-bb58-ab489f0b9a4c))
(text "Three concrete protected bipolar DC-window detectors are designed; threshold, RF loading and power-off\nbackfeed still need prototype qualification. v2.1 (owner decision): each sensed bias branch has an E2\nback-to-back P-MOSFET blocking element (Q2901/Q2902/Q2903 DMP6050SSD-13 with a 100 nF gate-source capacitor,\nheld open by low EN_LNA2/EN_LNA3/EN_BONI) between the protected E2 node (TPS2553/INA3221/U214, polarized\ncapacitors) and the E4 port node; ±30 V at the assembled port is a design target until bench-proven. Not\ncovered (W2 GR-2 review): the direct P8 port (ch4) has no DC-window detector and no blocking element. With the\nP8 accessory off-board, panel J408 → U.FL J427 sits on E4_RF_CH4, the RF_DC node of TCBT A424, whose DC port\nBIAS_CH4 runs through E2 L209 and shunt R246 to TPS2553 U209 OUT (E2_LNA4_SW; OUT abs max −0.3…7 V, TI\nTPS255xx Rev. G §6.1, https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps2553.pdf, read 2026-11-07) and the INA3221 U216\nchannel-1 inputs: foreign DC on P8 reaches that protected E2 node, and own ch4 bias reaches whatever is\nplugged into P8.\nВорота (стенд): Verify each DCS LOW at 0 V and HIGH by ±0.100 V in both sweep directions over the admitted\ntemperature/supply range; record thresholds/hysteresis. With own bias OFF and Q6A ON/OFF (3V3_Q6A <0.1 V when\nOFF), apply foreign DC at each assembled port P2/P3/HF_CM: (1) slow ±30 V limited DC; (2) fast-edge hot plug —\na pre-energised current-limited ±12/±24/±30 V source switched onto the port through a coax plug or relay.\nPass: BIAS_CH2/BIAS_CH3/BONI13V8 (TPS2553 OUT, INA3221 inputs, U214 OUT) stay within −0.3…+0.3 V, no INA/MCP\nfault; repeat at 0 °C and 50 °C. The DPS-150 cannot reach 30 V from the project's 20 V PD or 4S sources; use a\nsource that really delivers 30 V. Hot plug while own bias is ON is not covered and must not be tested\ndestructively. Also measure off-state leakage (protected-node rise <0.1 V at 50 °C), the on-state drop at\n184.5/54.5/80 mA including the cold VGS(th) corner (VGS ≈−4.2 V on the 4.30 V rail; total ≤0.25 V to the\nantenna), turn-on with and without trapped charge (the ≈48 µF protected reservoir dumps into the port outside\nthe TPS2553/U214 limit) and unchanged soft-start/ILIM. A shorted FET is not detectable; an open element on\nLNA2/LNA3 is silent. Measure RF tap and element IL/RL/NF impact. Require startup/reference-fault HIGH and own\nbias OFF ≥500 ms before preflight; readiness stays false until qualified. Check floating/open antenna as well\nas 0 Ω/50 Ω DC loads. Include the 996 Ω bleed load in current baselines and measure its RF loss/parasitics.\nReject false-safe at ±0.100 V; false-unsafe units also fail usability qualification. Also qualify cold\nminimum-supply reference-feed headroom: the arithmetic model requires D450 Vf ≤1.015 V at VDD 3.135 V and REF\n2.072 V for at least 80 µA LM4040 cathode current. Reference collapse must force HIGH, and must not be\nmisreported as a working detector. P8/ch4 (W2 GR-2): the foreign-DC test above cannot pass on P8, which has no\ndetector and no element; whether ch4 gets an E2 blocking element or a DC-window detector is an owner/E2\ndecision, OPEN under this gate. Until then P8 must never see a foreign DC source, and EN_LNA4 (low at startup,\ndesign/readiness-contract.json startup_output_requests; no DC preflight for LNA4 in software/srrx/policy.py\nDCS) is switched on only with the P8 accessory fitted (profile rule, STACK.md:78; no hardware check)." (at 13.97 51.63 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 530dec37-16da-52d4-8ce9-2ddd6cb1e82a))
