(text "E4-04 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.3 (S-band); поправки v2.1 (LaNA WB, cf2235-kt30)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 316.23 247.65 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid d30eb546-79cf-5f89-9a9a-3234a910540e))
(text "S-band module and supply selection are complete; external inline pod assembly, cable loss, gain/NF and\nthermal/current measurements remain unqualified.\nВорота (стенд): Build the specified LaNA WB 100845 + cf2235 + DC blocks in the Hammond 1554U2GY pod; verify\nstacked fit/cable bends, weather seals and strain relief. Measure LaNA current/inrush at protected 5 V,\n2.2–2.3 GHz S21/NF/linearity, and receiver protection. Do not substitute generic nominal NF for the actual\nS-band measurement." (at 316.23 249.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid cbdf43c5-805b-515b-acaa-36836e6b11db))
